@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowThickness 3

title Temporal Fusion Transformer, Role in MiRACLE

' Colors
' Inputs:  ***REMOVED***D9EDF7
' Model:   ***REMOVED***E6E6FA
' Output:  ***REMOVED***DFF0D8


rectangle "Physical features\nfrom PVLib" as PHYS ***REMOVED***D9EDF7
rectangle "Past covariates\n(historic PV + weather)\n as LSTM Encoding" as PAST ***REMOVED***D9EDF7
rectangle "Future covariates\n(weather forecast,\ncalendar features)\nfrom API polling" as FUT ***REMOVED***D9EDF7

rectangle "Temporal Fusion Transformer\n(variable selection + attention\nmulti horizon decoder)" as TFT ***REMOVED***E6E6FA

rectangle "30 day PV power forecast\n(multi horizon sequence)" as OUT ***REMOVED***DFF0D8


PHYS --> TFT
PAST --> TFT
FUT  --> TFT

TFT --> OUT

note bottom of TFT
  Learns which variables and time steps
  matter most and fuses latent temporal
  patterns, physics features, and
  forecast covariates.
end note

note bottom of OUT
  Forecast sequence that feeds the
  evaluation tables, RL controller,
  and dashboard in the MiRACLE pipeline.
end note

@enduml
